# The one pin of the Lean toolchain `bend PROOF.bend --verdict` builds the
# BendTT kernel with (bend2/bendtt.lean, in the Bend release bend.env pins),
# and of the kernel CI builds with it:
#
#   LEAN_VERSION              the Lean the pinned Bend asks for; bend refuses
#                             any other, so it moves with BEND_VERSION
#   LEAN_SHA256_LINUX_X64     the SHA-256 of
#                             github.com/leanprover/lean4/releases/download/v<version>/lean-<version>-linux.tar.zst,
#                             as GitHub's release API records the asset's digest
#   BENDTT_SHA256_LINUX_X64   the SHA-256 of the kernel binary bend builds
#                             with that toolchain on CI's linux-x64 runner
#
# install-lean.sh checks the tarball against the second; `bend.sh fetch` and
# `bend.sh kernel` check every kernel CI downloads from this repository's
# release or builds against the third, and `bend.sh verdict` checks $BENDTT
# against it; CI's `bend-proofs` job, .github/workflows/bendtt-release.yml and
# bend.sh read this file as data, one KEY=value a line, and never run it.
#
# The release asset is named by this platform's Bend tarball, Lean tarball
# and kernel pins together, so changing any of them names an asset nobody has
# published: CI then downloads the pinned Lean and builds the kernel.
#
# Moving Bend or Lean: change BEND_* in bend.env and LEAN_* here together.
# The pull request's CI builds the kernel and its `Provide the BendTT kernel`
# step fails, printing the new kernel's SHA-256; pin that as
# BENDTT_SHA256_LINUX_X64 and push again, and CI builds it once more and
# accepts it. Once it merges, publish the kernel from main:
#   gh workflow run bendtt-release.yml --repo englishstreetventures/osn --ref main -f publish=true
# A published asset that is not the pinned build fails every Bend proofs run:
# delete it (gh release delete-asset <tag> <asset> --repo
# englishstreetventures/osn; `bash tools/bend/bend.sh asset` names both) and
# dispatch the workflow again.
LEAN_VERSION=4.34.0
LEAN_SHA256_LINUX_X64=caaa98356098c85dc0fcbbd28e1ec66f39eb6551829972b752ff20e1286b646b
BENDTT_SHA256_LINUX_X64=b8833793dd6a2fa9c9a580c8de4423fcccea8e4ada4ac38a3702ff6c90bb9ba6
